Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.38,0:00:03.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even after getting his ass handed to him,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.60,0:00:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that Hazamada guy still\Nsaid he didn't know
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.58,0:00:08.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,anything about that Sparky\NSOB who killed my bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.46,0:00:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, apparently he's only ever\Ntalked to him over the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.60,0:00:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did torture that twat waffle\Nbefore he told you this, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.74,0:00:17.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He could have been lying to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.24,0:00:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I really believe Hazamada\Nwas telling me the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he knew the user's identity,\Nhe would have been killed by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.34,0:00:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, I guess you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.14,0:00:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is why my bro was offed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.52,0:00:30.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.43,0:00:32.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Hazemada's still breathing, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.62,0:00:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For now, that's all the proof we\Nneed that he's telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.76,0:00:38.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, Hazamada did\Ntell us about one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.78,0:00:41.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't ask me to tell you why this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.70,0:00:45.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it seems Stan users are\Ninadvertently drawn to each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.32,0:00:48.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even if the users have never\Nlaid eyes on one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.20,0:00:50.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've heard of the myth\Nthat says the red thread
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.34,0:00:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of fate forever connects\Nyou with your partner-to-be,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.00,0:00:53.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.91,0:00:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like in the myth, Stan users\Nare bound to cross paths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.14,0:01:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The user could be an enemy a friend that\Nannoying guy on the bus who steps on your
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.00,0:01:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,foot or even your new next door neighbor\Neveryone is suspect morio's a small town
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.94,0:01:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you know it's anybody's\Nguess how many stan
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.66,0:01:15.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,users are living here but tries they made
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.14,0:01:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to conceal themselves they'll eventually\Nemerge he knows it's just a matter of time
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.82,0:01:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,before destiny brings you together so he\Nwants you to disappear before that happens
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.56,0:01:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,damn it this shithead's a damn coward
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.38,0:01:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what the hell is he waiting for well he's
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.62,0:01:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,probably playing it safe for the time being\Nwhen guys like that decide to go on the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.02,0:01:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,offensive it's usually because they're\Nconfident that no one can take them I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.48,0:01:43.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.24,0:01:46.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.62,0:01:47.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.53,0:01:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Koichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.00,0:01:51.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but why is he at a snooty cafe?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.28,0:01:53.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoo-hoo! Koichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.42,0:01:55.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.68,0:01:59.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.80,0:02:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, it's the girl!
