Dialogue: 1,0:03:17.80,0:03:22.26,Title Part 4 Episode 2,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(654,590)\pos(139,880)\fs60}Episode 8: {\fs80} Yamagishi Yukako Falls in Love Part 1
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.88,0:03:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Koichi, I hope\Nmeeting me here wasn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.98,0:03:25.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,too much trouble. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.44,0:03:27.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't any trouble at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.32,0:03:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, there's nowhere\Nelse I'd rather be.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.20,0:03:31.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although I'm not quite\Nsure what this is about.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.42,0:03:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, Koichi's actually with a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.82,0:03:35.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And not just any girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.06,0:03:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's you, Kick Yamagishi, from my class!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.48,0:03:40.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's get a closer look!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.98,0:03:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure if this is about\Nshowing you my homework,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.78,0:03:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you should probably\Nknow my grades aren't
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.76,0:03:47.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all that good and my handwriting's sloppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.74,0:03:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though if it's money,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.04,0:03:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose I could give you a thousand yen,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.80,0:03:54.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or maybe you came here to ask me\Nto be the weekly class leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.18,0:03:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid it's none of\Nthose. Really? It isn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.46,0:03:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then why did you want to meet me here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.34,0:04:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're looking for someone\Nto take in a kitten or puppy,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.22,0:04:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to say I already\Nhave a dopey dog named police.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.96,0:04:05.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.04,0:04:08.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.60,0:04:15.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi, you need to know that I've\Nfallen madly in love with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.88,0:04:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did she say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.22,0:04:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I don't\Nthink I heard you right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.24,0:04:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.86,0:04:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every day all I think\Nabout is you, Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.34,0:04:30.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been oh so frightened\Nto utter those words to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.82,0:04:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, if I held it in any\Nlonger, my heart was going to burst.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.60,0:04:36.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I had to take a leap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.92,0:04:40.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And tell you my true feelings\Neven if you were to hate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.44,0:04:43.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this really happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.28,0:04:46.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is she actually professing her love to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.20,0:04:51.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't believe it if I hadn't\Nheard it, but that's what she said!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.88,0:04:54.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.72,0:04:57.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, please tell me\Nthis isn't happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.02,0:04:59.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does Koichi get all the luck?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.94,0:05:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one's ever said anything\Nlike that to me before!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.76,0:05:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you big baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.16,0:05:08.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no need to cry, but still holy\Ncrap that Koichi sure is something
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.30,0:05:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So Koichi, you must have\Na girlfriend already.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.90,0:05:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm as single as can be
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.80,0:05:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.20,0:05:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't tease me\Nabout something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.12,0:05:21.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you? No way. I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.18,0:05:24.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I Noticed your face has become\Nmore chiseled as of late?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.24,0:05:28.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A strong face brimming with\Ncourage and conviction!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.08,0:05:31.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, you're really\Ncharming when you smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.26,0:05:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, she's honestly\Nmaking a lot of good points.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.48,0:05:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a chiseled face too, don't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.78,0:05:42.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That said, what attracts me to a man\Nmore than anything else is potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.26,0:05:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you are potential personified.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.88,0:05:48.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's the first time\Nanyone's ever said that to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.14,0:05:50.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you must be repulsed\Nby homely girls like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.02,0:05:52.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't blame you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.40,0:05:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.00,0:05:56.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not how I see you at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.98,0:05:58.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you come on, you lucky bastard?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.78,0:06:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit messing around and seal\Nthe deal with that hottie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.18,0:06:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just go for it and ask her out already!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.20,0:06:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.54,0:06:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you hate me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.32,0:06:10.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.16,0:06:13.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't hate you even if I wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.84,0:06:14.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you love me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.84,0:06:16.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.26,0:06:19.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you think we're\Nmoving a bit too fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.72,0:06:20.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do hate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.26,0:06:22.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you've got it all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.10,0:06:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just caught me off guard when\Nyou started talking about love.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.64,0:06:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, which is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.90,0:06:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you madly in love or\Ntoying with my feelings?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.72,0:06:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answer me, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.12,0:06:32.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I poured my heart out to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.70,0:06:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now I've spilled my coffee!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.62,0:06:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All because of your heartlessness!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.24,0:06:43.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what just came over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.36,0:06:44.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.88,0:06:45.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.44,0:06:50.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.35,0:06:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll come see me again, I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.18,0:06:59.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I have to say, for some reason, I\Nsuddenly feel like a deflated balloon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.00,0:07:03.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any jealousy I had over that just\Nwent right out of the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.60,0:07:04.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.51,0:07:06.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's pretend we didn't see any of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.12,0:07:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.44,0:07:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with my cola?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.12,0:07:16.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why's all this hair in it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.84,0:07:18.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the world is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.26,0:07:22.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stand users are always\Ndrawn to each other, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.94,0:07:23.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it be?
