Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.24,0:07:40.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's me, Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.52,0:07:44.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no! Oh, Yukako!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.22,0:07:46.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.78,0:07:50.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, uh, it's my turn to clean the\Nlab so I'm doing my part to help out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.70,0:07:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fourth period was\Nchemistry lab, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.58,0:07:57.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.42,0:08:01.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About yesterday, I know I\Nsaid some strange things,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.80,0:08:03.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I hope you'll forget all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.80,0:08:08.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a bad habit of behaving\Nthat way when I overthink things.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.88,0:08:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so embarrassed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.42,0:08:13.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could I forget how important\Nit is to be open-minded?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.20,0:08:16.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's true, but don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.28,0:08:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You surprised me a little\Nbit, but it's no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.52,0:08:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think any less of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.32,0:08:25.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can still be friends despite\Nmy outburst, right? Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.50,0:08:26.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That works for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.60,0:08:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd love to be friends with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.00,0:08:30.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really? Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.18,0:08:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was so worried that\Nyou absolutely hated me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.80,0:08:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was tossing and turning all night!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.38,0:08:37.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's just silly!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.92,0:08:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as a little something to show\Nyou just how sorry I am. Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.72,0:08:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I so hope you like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.80,0:08:47.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I spent the whole night\Nknitting this for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.32,0:08:48.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what a relief!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.52,0:08:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew your length and chest width,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.86,0:08:53.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I had a guess about the\Nshoulders and it fits perfectly!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.84,0:08:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made you an amulet too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.80,0:08:57.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you can find true love!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.28,0:08:59.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there's more!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.40,0:09:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I also made us Bind boxes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.40,0:09:03.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything we need to have lunch together!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.10,0:09:08.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bought the shrimp at the\Nlocal market this morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.24,0:09:11.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't find freshness\Nlike this at a grocery store!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.26,0:09:16.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Flounder Minoru, but I made sure\Nto remove every single bone with tweezers!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.18,0:09:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now open wide, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.08,0:09:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As if yesterday wasn't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.14,0:09:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is definitive proof that Yukako\NYamagishi is completely deranged.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.80,0:09:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to put a stop to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.68,0:09:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if I take a bite, I'll\Njust validate her feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.44,0:09:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if I refuse, she'll kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.82,0:09:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.56,0:09:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Hirose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.14,0:09:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit goofing off, slacker.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.04,0:09:43.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Class is going to be starting any minute,\Nso hurry up and dump this garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.02,0:09:45.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, thank God for trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.38,0:09:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, how could I have forgotten?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.12,0:09:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of this right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.12,0:09:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Geez, you are totally hopeless!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.32,0:09:55.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, just give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.52,0:09:57.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take it outside for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.94,0:09:59.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's fine. I've got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.00,0:10:01.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just hand it over, would ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.84,0:10:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the class rep, so I'm the\None who's gonna get chewed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.08,0:10:05.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Geez.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.06,0:10:06.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.92,0:10:23.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey you huh I'll ask you one time to\Nstop flirting with Koichi what are you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.76,0:10:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,talking about do you mean Koichi Hirose\Nyou're joking right I don't know what
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.68,0:10:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you've heard but there's nothing going\Non with us that pathetic lie might have
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.34,0:10:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,worked on me if you didn't reek with\Nthe stench of a Malodorous homewrecker.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.00,0:10:36.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.91,0:10:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.52,0:10:39.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.72,0:10:42.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I catch you trying\Nto seduce Koichi again,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.44,0:10:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mark my words, I'll make\Nyour life a living hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.00,0:10:49.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hold your horses, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.88,0:10:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're threatening me over\Na spindly scrub like Koichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.18,0:10:55.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't give two shits about the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.90,0:10:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if I was all into him, you\Nhave absolutely no right to tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.64,0:11:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what I can or cannot do, dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.66,0:11:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, that hurt. What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.74,0:11:11.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is her problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.80,0:11:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That psycho is out of her mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.78,0:11:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She has the hots for Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.48,0:11:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, what a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.76,0:11:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just wait until the school finds out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.42,0:11:20.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.84,0:11:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.04,0:11:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.36,0:11:28.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.04,0:11:30.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.54,0:11:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It feels like I'm burning up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.52,0:11:40.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Water!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.30,0:11:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone help me! Water!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.92,0:11:48.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need water!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.56,0:11:49.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.38,0:11:57.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.00,0:12:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you were right about\NYukakoyama Gishi being a stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.26,0:12:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a stand that manipulates\Nhair at will! Seems like.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.86,0:12:08.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But given what we've seen,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.26,0:12:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it doesn't appear as though she'd go\Nafter Koichi or us for that matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.24,0:12:16.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, Okuyasu, what are you planning\Nto do about this girl's messed up hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.48,0:12:18.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure if you know this,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.44,0:12:22.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but Shining Diamond isn't able\Nto fix stuff the hand takes away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.30,0:12:23.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.21,0:12:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Haven't I done enough for one day?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.58,0:12:26.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did keep her from\Ngetting burned to a crisp.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.00,0:12:30.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if I wanted to do something,\NI'm not much of a hair stylist.
