Dialogue: 1,0:12:42.95,0:12:43.99,Eyecatch - Left,Signbot,0,0,0,,{\pos(81,794)}Hirose Koichi
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.36,0:12:45.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.90,0:12:47.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, what am I gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.02,0:12:51.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look what I got on my\Nlatest English test. Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.80,0:12:55.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yukako has been stressing me out so\Nmuch I haven't been able to concentrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.72,0:12:58.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh man, even I did better than you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.14,0:12:59.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got a 32 on that test.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.16,0:13:01.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm being honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.36,0:13:03.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when she started paying attention to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.26,0:13:05.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was a little excited about\Nwhere things were going.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.76,0:13:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, no girl's ever\Nsaid she loved me before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.24,0:13:12.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I totally feel what you're\Nsaying on that one, my man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.38,0:13:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel you deeply. Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.62,0:13:19.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was way too wishy-washy about my feelings\Nand brought this all on myself, darn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.08,0:13:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's only one way to\Nend this madness now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.50,0:13:25.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to tell Yukako that I'm not\Ninterested in her, so she leaves me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.14,0:13:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd think twice about that, Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.86,0:13:28.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you try being that blunt with her,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.90,0:13:32.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it'll only fan the demented\Nflames of her passion even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.64,0:13:33.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'll lose it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.36,0:13:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.16,0:13:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, of course I'm right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.58,0:13:39.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.66,0:13:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yukako is insane,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.92,0:13:44.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but convincing her to stop using\Nher hair for evil is low priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.74,0:13:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have far more pressing\Nconcerns at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.80,0:13:50.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Figuring out a way to not\Nprovoke her comes first.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.60,0:13:52.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how do we do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.36,0:13:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The truth is, it doesn't matter\Nhow infatuated she is with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.70,0:13:58.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If she comes to her own conclusion\Nthat you're the most pathetic,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.62,0:14:03.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,disgusting schmuck around, then we get to\Ngo on living happily ever after, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.22,0:14:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So all you've got to do\Non your end is act like
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.42,0:14:08.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a total jackass whenever\Nyou're in front of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.62,0:14:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, now I get where\Nyou're going with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.80,0:14:12.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're such a genius, Josuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.00,0:14:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.22,0:14:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though is it really a\Ncompliment coming from you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.98,0:14:21.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, Luis, what could I do to make\NYukako think I'm totally unappealing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.46,0:14:22.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.37,0:14:23.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from what I've been told,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.50,0:14:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mama's boys and gross guys are\Nusually major turn-offs for ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.16,0:14:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There has to be another way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.84,0:14:32.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If she thinks I'm a mama's boy, she'll\Nhate my mom and go after her, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.58,0:14:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we'll have to go with option B!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.54,0:14:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be the gross guy\Nwho doesn't take baths!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.00,0:14:37.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.94,0:14:40.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't brush your teeth\Nor change your underwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.64,0:14:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raising some lice or spiders in\Nyour hair might be a good idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.96,0:14:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wearing sweaty socks is pretty gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.94,0:14:47.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, and try farting everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.88,0:14:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she'll think you're foul!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.62,0:14:50.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you guys quit joking?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.90,0:14:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Around I'm serious about\Nthis I'm being just as
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.94,0:14:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,serious as you are now make\Nwith the snot and drool.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.08,0:15:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're not up for it\Nthen your only option is
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.80,0:15:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to become a nobody and a\Nnobody with no prospects?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.52,0:15:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At that you need to make\Nher lose all interests
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.84,0:15:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you and I are going to tackle\Nthis thing together. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.88,0:15:23.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy shit! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.72,0:15:25.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi Hirose did what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.38,0:15:26.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.94,0:15:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How disgusting does a guy have\Nto be to stoop to shoplifting?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.50,0:15:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, but Koichi said it himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.02,0:15:35.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's worse, the jerk was\Neven bragging all about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.48,0:15:36.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who does that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.46,0:15:37.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think that's bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.50,0:15:40.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi wouldn't be able to keep a\Npromise if his life depended on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.64,0:15:43.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I lent that asshat money\Nand he never paid me back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.58,0:15:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, I heard he cheats on\Ntests and steals girls' underwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.54,0:15:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The guy's got no future.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.38,0:15:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll end up ruining his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.92,0:15:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's time to drop the dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.66,0:15:54.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our friendship is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.04,0:16:03.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, that chick gives\NIntense a new definition.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.86,0:16:07.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, if Koichi can confirm tomorrow\Nall the stuff we said today,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.24,0:16:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she'll lose interest faster than\Na lead block fallen from the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.40,0:16:17.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I should have faith in them,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.64,0:16:20.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I wonder if Josuke\Nand Okuyasu's plan worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.06,0:16:27.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The best-case scenario would be her\Nforgetting that I exist altogether.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.68,0:16:39.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.00,0:16:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My eyes are closed, so it must be a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.02,0:16:44.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.93,0:16:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.52,0:16:49.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Yukako!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.04,0:16:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to be kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.44,0:16:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's even corrupting my dreams?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.04,0:16:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't she give it a rest for one night?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.62,0:17:01.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.16,0:17:02.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.74,0:17:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to do this, Koichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.92,0:17:15.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I have to tell you, your friends\Ndon't think very highly of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.28,0:17:23.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No need to worry, I'm here for you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.46,0:17:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as such, it's my job to educate\Nyou and turn you into the ideal man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.34,0:17:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.62,0:17:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Certain other men seem to be lacking,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.30,0:17:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it's crucial that you\Nlive up to that potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.76,0:17:37.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.76,0:17:39.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The plan backfired big time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.20,0:17:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.00,0:18:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi, are you hungry now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.98,0:18:12.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Breakfast is almost ready, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.14,0:18:15.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.00,0:18:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to remember that\Nshe has that hair stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.76,0:18:22.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no fighting it, so I\Nhave to find an opening and run.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.88,0:18:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my only hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.36,0:18:27.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I have a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.34,0:18:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you answer it? I'll try.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.72,0:18:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's about what\Nyour hair did last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.20,0:18:33.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.70,0:18:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were you surprised?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.20,0:18:36.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silly me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.36,0:18:38.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose the first time\Nwould startle anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.90,0:18:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was around February.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.28,0:18:43.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody shot an arrow into my chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.02,0:18:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though, it's possible I was dreaming it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.94,0:18:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I woke up, it was as if my wound\Nnever existed, and I had this power.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.00,0:18:55.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keicho Nijimura!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.76,0:18:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, do you know anyone else with\Nspecial powers like yours? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.26,0:19:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means she has no\Nidea I'm a stand user too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.44,0:19:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a seat if you would.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.46,0:19:07.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are a growing boy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.46,0:19:09.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you don't eat properly,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.60,0:19:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll never become the outstanding\Nman I know you can be. Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.98,0:19:15.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to play along for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.14,0:19:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This looks amazing! Oh, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.84,0:19:20.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not so fast, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.24,0:19:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to talk. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.80,0:19:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You failed your English test.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.66,0:19:27.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While I acknowledge there's more\Nto a man than his intelligence,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.92,0:19:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this pitiful score is unacceptable.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.02,0:19:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To prepare you for the next test, You're\Ngoing to study while you eat breakfast,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.28,0:19:35.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.20,0:19:42.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, for a few questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.52,0:19:45.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Select the best answer\Nfrom among the boxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.22,0:19:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The box you choose holds your next meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.34,0:19:48.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.86,0:19:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll do what I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.08,0:19:51.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as long as you're\Nliving in this house,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.00,0:19:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your life must constantly\Nrevolve around your betterment.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.64,0:19:55.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agreed?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.30,0:19:58.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On to the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.80,0:19:59.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In Prince's lyrics,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.02,0:20:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he uses the words funky music and I\Nwant the best Japanese translation. A.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.90,0:20:06.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nekkyō no ongaku. B.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.30,0:20:09.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Genshi no ongaku. C.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.80,0:20:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gensou no ongaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.14,0:20:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I don't answer her question,\Nshe'll get hysterical!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.36,0:20:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't have a flippin' clue!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.20,0:20:22.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a hunch it's A, but it\Ncould easily be B or C as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.94,0:20:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tch...screw it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.86,0:20:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.20,0:20:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tch...my guess is... B!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.86,0:20:36.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.14,0:20:36.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.05,0:20:39.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won a pair of\Nfreshly hard-boiled eggs!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.48,0:20:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll peel them for you with\Na pinch of salt, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.00,0:20:48.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just so you know, if you had chosen A,\Nyou would have had to eat this eraser.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.14,0:20:51.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Box C would have been a bar of soap.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.56,0:20:53.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.80,0:20:56.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The next item on the\Nmenu is bacon and eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.50,0:20:57.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Best of luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.41,0:20:58.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your question.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.48,0:21:02.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which of these characters\Nexpress contrast?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.48,0:21:07.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would it be Dish A, perhaps\NDish B, or maybe Dish C?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:02.53,0:21:07.82,Note,,0,0,0,,Note: The second character for each answer is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.88,0:21:09.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's not messing around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.80,0:21:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I choose the wrong box, she'll\Nforce me to eat its contents for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.84,0:21:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you're stalling for time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.98,0:21:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry or your food will get cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.06,0:21:19.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.24,0:21:21.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.44,0:21:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do I do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.24,0:21:24.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's playing hardball!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.36,0:21:28.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.70,0:21:30.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Duh! Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.54,0:21:35.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Duh! Is... Itsy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.18,0:21:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.94,0:21:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were you watching my expressions\Nto decide which box to pick? Duh!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.36,0:21:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never thought I'd say this,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.20,0:21:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but your reputation for being a\Nconniving shoplifting traitor is true!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.10,0:21:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For your penalty, you shall consume\Nthe contents of boxes A and B!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.06,0:21:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A is English vocab Corn Flakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.28,0:21:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,B is asparagus a la English dictionary.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.38,0:21:59.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna learn with\Nevery bite you take.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.82,0:22:05.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, now open up that mouth,\Nbecause here comes the knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.54,0:22:07.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.04,0:22:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eat your food, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.68,0:22:13.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had about enough of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.48,0:22:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You expect me to sit\Nback and take this crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.72,0:22:16.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.66,0:22:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.08,0:22:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.20,0:22:24.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's pulling my scalp?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.90,0:22:26.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It feels like somebody's hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.70,0:22:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, does this belong to?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.02,0:22:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed, I implanted a few hundred\Nstrands of my own hair into your scalp.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.84,0:22:38.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm well aware that you'll probably hate
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.02,0:22:40.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me for going to these extreme measures,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.00,0:22:41.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.34,0:22:44.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But by the time you leave this house,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.38,0:22:48.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll look in the mirror and see a\Nbrand new man staring back at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.14,0:22:50.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm certain you'll thank me after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.52,0:22:54.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And and you'll realize you need\Na woman like me in your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.14,0:22:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's safe to say you won't be able\Nto live without Yukako Yamagishi.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.24,0:23:01.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you might as well know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.04,0:23:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until you finish every\Nlast morsel on your plates,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.72,0:23:06.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't be giving you any more food.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.62,0:23:08.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.12,0:23:13.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A famous CEO vacations here, but no\None will be visiting until summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.86,0:23:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until summer?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.38,0:23:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although, it doesn't\Nreally matter who drops by,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.76,0:23:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because, in the very end,\Nlove is an invincible power.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.86,0:23:32.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody help me!
